 align="" frameborder="" height="" scrolling="no" width="" class="" style="height:2em;width: 100%;margin: 0;padding: 0;border: 0;background: transparent;"></iframe></p> </div> <div class="creditBottomRate" style="position:relative;height:30px;"> <div style="text-align: center; top: 0px;"></div> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div style="text-align: center;"> <p>Hi there, welcome to my author page!</p> </div> <br /> I've been a fan of the site for over a decade, and became an active member in 2018. It's awesome being able to contribute to the site, and hopefully you enjoy some of the things I've written! I'm based in the UK, and am always happy to crit a draft if you see me around on chat. Aware this page is a bit bare bones at the moment, but hopefully there'll be more articles added over the coming months. <hr /> <div style="text-align: center;"> <p><span style="font-size:20px;"><strong><span style="text-decoration: underline;">SCPs:</span></strong></span></p> </div> <table style="border-collapse:collapse; width: 100%;"> <tr> <td style="font-weight:bold;padding: .5em .50em; text-align: center; border: 4px solid white; background-color: #3d3b3f; width: 33%;"> <p><span style="font-size:20px;"><span style="color: #ffffff">SCP-3804</span></span></p> </td> <td style="font-weight:bold;padding: .0em .50em; text-align: center; border: 4px solid white; background-color: #3d3b3f; width: 33%;"> <p><span style="font-size:20px;"><span style="color: #ffffff">SCP-4075</span></span></p> </td> <td style="font-weight:bold;padding: .50em .50em; text-align: center; border: 4px solid white; background-color: #3d3b3f; width: 33%;"> <p><span style="font-size:20px;"><span style="color: #ffffff">SCP-5733</span></span></p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td style="font-weight:bold;padding: 0em 0em; text-align: center; border: 4px solid white; width: 33%;"><a href="http://scp-wiki.wikidot.com/scp-3804"><img src="http://scp-wiki.wdfiles.com/local--files/dysadron/3804.jpg" class="gray-image" alt="3804.jpg" /><