884163&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1607545243" alt="Jakob17" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5884163)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/jakob17" >Jakob17</a></span></p> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">►&nbsp;Translations!</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">▼&nbsp;The&nbsp;fact&nbsp;that&nbsp;people&nbsp;want&nbsp;to&nbsp;translate&nbsp;my&nbsp;stuff&nbsp;feels&nbsp;like&nbsp;even&nbsp;a&nbsp;larger&nbsp;fever&nbsp;dream</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"> <ul> <li><strong><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/the-watchman">The Watchman</a></strong> - on the Chinese Wiki Branch</li> <li><strong><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/the-overseer">The Overseer</a></strong> - on the Chinese Wiki Branch</li> <li><strong><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-5464">SCP-5464</a></strong> - on the Chinese Wiki Branch</li> <li><strong><a href="http://scp-wiki.net.pl/scp-5464">SCP-5464</a></strong> - on the Polish Wiki Branch</li> </ul> </div> </div> </div> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">►&nbsp;What's&nbsp;up&nbsp;with&nbsp;those&nbsp;small&nbsp;images&nbsp;at&nbsp;the&nbsp;top&nbsp;of&nbsp;the&nbsp;page?</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">▼&nbsp;What's&nbsp;up&nbsp;with&nbsp;those&nbsp;small&nbsp;images&nbsp;at&nbsp;the&nbsp;top&nbsp;of&nbsp;the&nbsp;page?</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"> <p>These are <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-achievement-badges">SCP Achievement Badges</a>, a cool litt