&lt;div class=&quot;wilson-body&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Due to recent events, the Critter Profile for our good boy Sparky is no longer up-to-date. I will try to personally update it with relevant information regarding him and our guest within the next couple of days. I just need to sit with what happened for a while. Thank you for your understanding.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
