ng SCP-5138-2 will go unconscious and when woken up will instantly go mad once 2 minutes pass the victim will see hallucinations after 10 minutes will start wandering around acting like different barn animals and then finally after 12 minutes will scream in pain then fall to the ground.<br /> SCP-5138-1 when hatched immediately grows and becomes a adult studies on how this happens are still going on.</p> <p><strong>Test 1</strong><br /> D-6367 is a 23 skinny man suffering from depression.<br /> D-6367 walk in the room and fell unconscious 1minute later he woke up. D-6367 began<br /> screaming and banging on the wall &quot;LET ME OUT!&quot; D-6367 has now reached stage one<br /> and is now banging on 1 way glass almost if he can see through it. D-6367 has reached<br /> stage 2 and is hiding while screaming in the corner &quot;NO GO, AWAY, go away <em>go away</em><br /> NO!&quot; soon we observed D-6367 behaving like a cow screaming &quot;MOO!&quot; while bashing his<br /> head into the wall This was stage 3. Last D-6367 screamed in pain and collapsed on the<br /> floor.</p> <p>by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/drdoctordoctor" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=7100224&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1607545248" alt="DrDoctorDoctor" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=7100224)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/drdoctordoctor" >DrDoctorDoctor</a></span></p> 
